    },
    "strength": "medium",
    "remedy": "Damages to the Company for the excess over an arm's-length price; if the whole transaction failed the express conditions, potentially disgorgement of all payments. Measure needs a third-party fee benchmark (QUESTIONS.md Q5) — the full $1,050,000 is the ceiling, not the floor. Recovery flows to the Company (Tooley), so Imani captures only her percentage of it: this is settlement leverage, not a payout."
