    },
    "strength": "medium",
    "remedy": "Damages/disgorgement to the Company; amount currently unquantifiable from the file and potentially larger than the fixed fees. If annualized 6% of gross rents exceeded $50,000 in any year (near certain for a property supporting $14.5M enterprise value), the disclosure condition applied and was breached."
